{"id":"wb-3-177","name":"焦山碑林","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T12:17:40+00:00","status":"ready","title":"焦山碑林","text":"焦山碑林是中国江苏省镇江市焦山公园内的一处景点。\n\n自宋朝起便有文人在焦山题字刻石，但是自晚清开始，屡遭兵燹，文革时又经历更大破坏，所藏碑刻或毁或失。1960年，经镇江政府抢救，外加从民间收集，陆续重建。1988年列为全国重点文物保护单位。1991年10月建立镇江焦山碑刻博物馆。\n\n关键藏品包括《瘗鹤铭》、唐刻《金刚经偈句》、宋刻《米芾题名、题刻》、《陆游踏雪观瘗鹤铭》、清刻全套《澄鉴堂石刻》等。","shortened":true,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%84%A6%E5%B1%B1%E7%A2%91%E6%9E%97","revisionId":94974265,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94974265","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/27504b71aba5e845197dcb30.jpg","title":"踏雪观瘗鹤铭0782.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E8%B8%8F%E9%9B%AA%E8%A7%82%E7%98%97%E9%B9%A4%E9%93%AD0782.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/63/%E8%B8%8F%E9%9B%AA%E8%A7%82%E7%98%97%E9%B9%A4%E9%93%AD0782.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Cangminzho","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​陆游踏雪观瘗鹤铭","width":320,"height":213},"textScope":"body-excerpt"}